Discard local changes to a spec

Usage: akm skills revert [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  Spec ID to revert

Options:
      --remote   Take the registry's current version instead of the last synced one
      --force    Skip the confirmation prompt
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
